# Autonomous delivery

Commit and push finished work. Use a conventional Chinese commit message.
Do not stop because the user did not say "commit" or "push".

Run routine production recovery, release, and health checks through the
protected GitHub workflows when that is the task. Do not ask again.

Stop only before deleting production business data or D1, rotating secrets,
sending a real test notification, rewriting Git history, or force-pushing main.
